    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.2">
        <head>Cn 1018 2.2</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="2.2" corresp="#wit-d">Ðonne is swiðe rihtlic. þæt godes ciricgrið. binnon wágum. 7 cristenes cynges handgrið stande efen unwæmme</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">Ðonne is swiðe rihtlic, þæt Godes ciricgrið binnon wagum and Cristenes cynges handgrið stande efenunwæmme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">It is accordingly very proper that God's protection of the church within its walls, and the handgiven protection of a Christian king, should stand equally inviolate.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">Accordingly, it is most proper that the sanctuary within the walls of God’s church and the protection received from a Christian king’s hand remain equally inviolate.</ab>
      </div>
